  "contracts": [
    {
      "name": "ugv_area_recon_configure",
      "description": "配置侦察动作 (对应文档 mar_motion_cfg_srv / MarMotionCfg)。\n\n    两种扫描样式，都支持**边走边侦察**（底盘机动与侦察不互斥，可先/同时下达\n    机动任务，车一边走一边扫）：\n      - scan_mode=1 区域侦察：界面画点圈定区域，云台在区域内蛇形覆盖扫描；区域\n        只用于规划扫描角度，不限制目标位置；目标仍须位于光电视场和探测距离内且无遮挡。\n      - scan_mode=2 周扫侦察：不圈区域，光电以车体为中心 360° 环扫，同样上报\n        当前光电视场内的所有目标；扫描方位随车体转动，行进中即沿途搜索。\n    配置成功后用 ugv_area_recon_control(1) 启动扫描。\n\n    Args:\n        region_points: 区域顶点 GNSS 列表，每点 [longitude, latitude, altitude]\n            (altitude 可省略，默认 0)。scan_mode=1 必填；scan_mode=2 周扫忽略此项。\n        region_type: 区域类型(RegionTypeEnum)：2-点,3-线,4-圆,5-多边形(默认)。\n            圆形时 points[0]=圆心、points[1]=圆上一点。\n        target_types: ZH 目标类型列表(TargetTypeEnum)，空表示所有类型(如 [2]=坦克)。\n        scan_num: 扫描次数(周扫=圈数)，达到后停止；0 表示不以次数停止。\n        lock_duration_limit: 锁定时长上限(秒)，超时自动解锁恢复；0 表示一直保持。\n        recon_type: ZH 设备类型：1-自适应,2-可见光,3-红外,4-DC。\n        scan_speed: 云台扫描速度(度/秒)。\n        scan_mode: 扫描样式：1-区域侦察(默认)，2-周扫侦察(360° 环扫，无需区域)。\n        scan_pitch: 周扫俯仰角(度，0=水平，负值向下压)；仅 scan_mode=2 生效。\n        mission_id: 任务唯一标识符；填 0 由服务端自动生成。\n\n    Returns:\n        {mission_id, state, state_label, message, res, fail_data}(res/fail_data 对应 MotionCfgRes)。\n        区域侦察(scan_mode=1)另返回 coverability 结构化可覆盖性判定:\n        {coverable: \"full\"完全可覆盖 / \"partial\"部分超距 / \"none\"完全超距(仍接受\n        配置，可先机动靠近边走边侦察) / \"unknown\"机位不可用未预检, coverable_label,\n        region_min_dist_m, region_max_dist_m, detection_range_m}；周扫无此字段。\n    ",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "region_points": {
            "default": null,
            "items": {},
            "title": "Region Points",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "region_type": {
            "default": 5,
            "title": "Region Type",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "target_types": {
            "default": null,
            "items": {},
            "title": "Target Types",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "scan_num": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Scan Num",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "lock_duration_limit": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Lock Duration Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "recon_type": {
            "default": 1,
            "title": "Recon Type",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "scan_speed": {
            "default": 30,
            "title": "Scan Speed",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "scan_mode": {
            "default": 1,
            "title": "Scan Mode",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "scan_pitch": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Scan Pitch",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "mission_id": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Mission Id",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "title": "ugv_area_recon_configureArguments"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ugv_area_recon_control",
      "description": "控制侦察动作 (对应文档 mar_motion_ctrl_srv；区域侦察与周扫共用)。\n\n    启动=开始扫描；暂停=停止扫描并解除锁定(若有)，云台保持；继续=恢复扫描；\n    停止=结束动作，云台回到初始角度。\n    扫描期间车辆可正常机动(边走边侦察)，无需先停车。\n\n    Args:\n        cmd_type: 控制指令(CtrlCmdTypeEnum)：1-启动,2-暂停,3-继续,4-停止。\n        mission_id: 任务唯一标识符；填 0 由服务端自动生成。\n\n    Returns:\n        {mission_id, state, state_label, message, cmd_res}(cmd_res 为 CmdResEnum)。\n    ",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "cmd_type": {
            "title": "Cmd Type",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "mission_id": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Mission Id",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": ["cmd_type"],
        "title": "ugv_area_recon_controlArguments"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ugv_area_recon_get_status",
      "description": "获取侦察动作状态 (对应文档 mar_report_status_msg / mar_report_mode_msg)。\n\n    返回 {status, status_label, scan_mode, scan_mode_label, scan_pitch,\n    out_of_range, camera_fault, scan_num, progress, work_mode, recon_type,\n    load_status, load_status_label, lock:{stage, target_id, role_name, duration_sec},\n    attack_ready, online, gimbal}。\n    status 为 MotionStatusEnum(1-空闲,3-就绪,5-运行中,8-暂停,9-被中断,11-结束…)；\n    scan_mode: 1-区域侦察/2-周扫侦察；progress: 配置了固定圈数(scan_num>0)时=圈数进度\n    ((已完成圈数+本圈完成度)/scan_num, 如配 10 圈扫完 2 圈=20%, 结束=100)；连续侦察\n    (scan_num=0)时 区域=面积覆盖率、周扫=本圈方位覆盖率(每圈清零重计)；\n    out_of_range=true 表示区域暂时超出探测半径(边走边侦察途中的过程态，不是失败)；\n    camera_fault=true 表示光电机位不可信(位姿零变换或远离载体)，此时覆盖率与目标已\n    停止累积、progress 停在故障前的值，应按载荷失效处理而非按低进度等待；\n    work_mode: 1-自动,2-遥控；attack_ready=true 表示已锁定目标可打击确认。\n    ",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "title": "ugv_area_recon_get_statusArguments"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ugv_area_recon_get_targets",
      "description": "获取当前侦察到的目标列表 (对应文档 mar_report_target_msg / MarTargetMsg)。\n\n    返回 {targets: [MarTargetInfo, ...]}，每个目标含 capture_time_us、target_id、\n    type(TargetTypeEnum)、position(PointGNSS)、velocity(VelocityENU)、distance、\n    confidence、threat、damage、lock_time、pixel_pos(PixelPosition) 及 camp。\n    锁定/打击用 target_id。\n\n    侦察动作运行时返回载荷上报的目标(字段完整)；未启动/已停止侦察时列表为\n    空——检测与上报均由区域侦察驱动(画面框与目标列表同源一致)，拿 target_id\n    锁定/打击前需先启动区域侦察。\n    ",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "title": "ugv_area_recon_get_targetsArguments"
      }
    }
  ],
